  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Norway Strategic Partnership Agreement Ukraine and Neighbouring Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Programme is to save lives, alleviate suffering and protect human dignuty in lone with the humanitarian pronciples. This will be achieved by providing assistance primarily in the sectors of protection, WASH, and food security. Additionally, the project aims at reducing vulnerabilty of beneficiaries ensuring result sustainabilty. Gender perspectives are mainstreamed across the activities, in addition to being a particular focus of the protection component. 
This part of the agreement is earmarked for Moldova.</narrative>
  </description>
